---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
import { serviceSplitText } from "./service-split";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang),
  s = serviceSplitText(lang, "monolith");
---

<section data-demo="monolith" lang={lang}>
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">{s.fiction}</p>
    <h2>
      {t(
        "One artifact moves together",
        "하나의 배포물이 함께 이동",
        "一つの成果物をまとめて更新",
      )}
    </h2>
    <p data-fixture>{s.fixture}</p>
    <p class="change" data-change>
      {s.change}
    </p>
  </header>
  <div class="release" data-deployment>
    <div class="release-heading">
      <h3>{s.unit} · 1</h3>
      <strong data-version>
        {t("App v1 → App v2", "앱 v1 → 앱 v2", "アプリv1 → アプリv2")}
      </strong>
    </div>
    <p class="scope">
      {t(
        "Build and release the whole server application",
        "서버 애플리케이션 전체 빌드·배포",
        "サーバーアプリケーション全体をビルド・デプロイ",
      )}
    </p>
    <ol class="capabilities">
      {[s.catalog, s.library, s.billing].map((name, index) => (
        <li data-capability class:list={{ changed: index === 1 }}>
          <span class="number" aria-hidden="true">
            0{index + 1}
          </span>
          <h4>{name}</h4>
          <p>{index === 1 ? s.tagAdded : s.unchanged}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <p class="local" data-communication>
      {s.library} → {s.catalog} · {s.local}
    </p>
    <p class="scope">
      {t(
        "Capability boxes leave internal modularity unspecified.",
        "기능 상자는 내부 모듈 구성 여부를 정하지 않습니다.",
        "機能の枠は内部のモジュール構成を規定しません。",
      )}
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="store" data-store>
    <h3>
      {t(
        "Shared database · owner: application",
        "공유 데이터베이스 · 소유자: 앱",
        "共有データベース · 所有者：アプリ",
      )}
    </h3>
    <p>
      {s.catalog} / {s.library} / {s.billing}
    </p>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Library writes the tag after Catalog lookup succeeds.",
        "카탈로그 조회 성공 후 보관함이 태그 기록.",
        "カタログ参照の成功後、ライブラリがタグを記録。",
      )}
    </p>
  </div>
  <ol class="outcomes" data-outcomes>
    <li data-result="success">{s.success}</li>
    <li data-result="failure">{s.failure}</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="boundary" data-boundary>
    {t(
      "Replicas are copies of the same artifact, not separate services. A process crash can affect all capabilities in that replica.",
      "복제본은 같은 배포물의 사본이며 별도 서비스가 아닙니다. 프로세스가 죽으면 해당 복제본의 모든 기능이 영향을 받습니다.",
      "レプリカは同じ成果物のコピーで、別サービスではありません。プロセス停止はそのレプリカの全機能に影響し得ます。",
    )}
  </p>
  <p class="footnote">{s.storeNote}</p>
</section>
<style>
  section {
    container-type: inline-size;
    padding: clamp(16px, 4vw, 28px);
    color: #294054;
    background: #eef3f8;
    border: 1px solid #8094a5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  p,
  h2,
  h3,
  h4,
  ol {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: #294054;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.65rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.7rem;
  }
  h3,
  h4 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .change {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .release {
    border: 2px dotted #597993;
    padding: 1rem;
    margin: 1.2rem 0;
  }
  .release-heading {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .release-heading strong {
    background: #294054;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .scope {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }
  .capabilities {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .capabilities li {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #8094a5;
    padding: 0.8rem;
  }
  .capabilities .changed {
    border: 2px solid #294054;
  }
  .number {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .capabilities p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }
  .local {
    border-top: 2px solid #597993;
    padding-top: 0.6rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .store {
    border: 1px solid #8094a5;
    border-left: 5px solid #597993;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .store p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }
  .outcomes {
    padding-left: 1.3rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .outcomes li + li {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .boundary {
    border-top: 1px solid #8094a5;
    padding-top: 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .footnote {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  @container (max-width: 520px) {
    .capabilities {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (forced-colors: active) {
    .release,
    .capabilities li,
    .store,
    .local,
    .boundary {
      border-color: CanvasText;
    }
  }
</style>
